window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c377-653b5df22a397878.json"]={sha256:"653b5df22a397878260a6267ca0586033c3f855a3ef23372b71717ec2d42d5e1",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-62ce26e30ad63de7","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/history/35-years-ago-launch-of-mir-space-stations-first-module/","title":"NASA History: Launch of Mir First Module","titleEn":"NASA History: Launch of Mir First Module","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c377","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c377","related":[{"id":"c378","referenceUrls":["https://www.nasa.gov/reference/the-space-shuttle/"],"title":"Space Shuttle 太空梭工程史","titleEn":"Space Shuttle engineering history","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學要求 0.99 時表面雙路通過、共用電源實際模型失敗，需處理共因項。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: At a 0.99 teaching target, nominal redundancy passes but the shared-power model fails, requiring common-cause treatment. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"從動能尺度理解再入能量管理，區分總耗散能與局部熱流。","differenceEn":"Use kinetic-energy scale to understand entry energy management, separating total dissipation from local heat flux.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學兩條資料路徑各可用度 0.98，先假設完全獨立且電源理想。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：A=1−0.02²。 結果約 0.9996 fraction。獨立並聯兩路可用度 A=1−(1−a)²；若共用電源，需再乘其可用度。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學質量 80000 kg、速度 7500 m/s，以 GJ 報告。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：E=0.5×80000×7500²/10⁹。 結果約 2250 GJ。平移動能 E=mv²/2；不是全部都進入熱防護，忽略勢能與旋轉。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Each of two teaching data paths has availability 0.98, initially assuming independence and ideal power. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: A=1−0.02². Result ≈ 0.9996 fraction. Two independent parallel paths have A=1−(1−a)²; a shared power source multiplies the result by its availability.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use teaching mass 80000 kg and speed 7500 m/s; report in GJ. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: E=0.5×80000×7500²/10⁹. Result ≈ 2250 GJ. Translational E=mv²/2 is not all absorbed by thermal protection and excludes potential and rotational energy.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c387","referenceUrls":["https://www.gps.gov/gps"],"title":"GPS 民用定位系統","titleEn":"GPS civilian positioning system","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學要求 0.99 時表面雙路通過、共用電源實際模型失敗，需處理共因項。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: At a 0.99 teaching target, nominal redundancy passes but the shared-power model fails, requiring common-cause treatment. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"把接收器時鐘偏差換成偽距誤差，說明為何必須共同估計時鐘。","differenceEn":"Convert receiver clock bias into pseudorange error and explain joint clock estimation.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學兩條資料路徑各可用度 0.98，先假設完全獨立且電源理想。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：A=1−0.02²。 結果約 0.9996 fraction。獨立並聯兩路可用度 A=1−(1−a)²；若共用電源，需再乘其可用度。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學光速取 3×10⁸ m/s，接收器時鐘慢或快的符號另定，偏差大小 20 ns。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：|δρ|=3×10⁸×20×10⁻⁹。 結果約 6 m。偽距包含幾何距離加 cδt；所有衛星共用的接收器時鐘偏差不等於每軸位置誤差。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Each of two teaching data paths has availability 0.98, initially assuming independence and ideal power. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: A=1−0.02². Result ≈ 0.9996 fraction. Two independent parallel paths have A=1−(1−a)²; a shared power source multiplies the result by its availability.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use teaching c=3×10⁸ m/s and clock-bias magnitude 20 ns, defining sign separately. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: |δρ|=3×10⁸×20×10⁻⁹. Result ≈ 6 m. Pseudorange includes geometric range plus cδt; common receiver-clock bias is not a per-axis position error.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-3057b76566dc5edf","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/reference/the-space-shuttle/","title":"NASA The Space Shuttle","titleEn":"NASA The Space Shuttle","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-6d966c87775eae0d","url":"https://www.gps.gov/gps","title":"GPS.gov GPS overview","titleEn":"GPS.gov GPS overview","publisher":"US GPS.gov","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
